WEBVTT

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.560
A real bed!

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.380
It's so nice after all that camping!

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:15.410
What?

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.720
What's wrong?

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.700
Rein! The beds are nice and fluffy!

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.640
<i>Why is this happening?!</i>

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.600
I'm so glad you like it!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.320
Good luck, you two!

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.290
Good luck with what?!

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.020
So fluffy!

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:43.860
<b>Beast Tamer</b>

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.680
<i>Hauling in the Ebon Fangs that Kanade 
and I caught took us until nightfall.</i>

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:07.310
Another Ultimate Species

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.400
<i>After that, we were called 
to the Adventurer's Guild.</i>

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:14.980
<i>Our elimination of the Ebon Fangs 
was deemed such an achievement,</i>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.740
<i>that I was given a special 
promotion to E-rank.</i>

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.700
<i>I was also given a rather sizable reward.</i>

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.410
<i>So we picked up some equipment in town,</i>

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.490
<i>then celebrated with a 
rather luxurious dinner.</i>

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:29.620
<i>But...</i>

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.210
I'm so sorry.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.200
We only have one room open tonight.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.970
All right, we'll try another inn—

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.590
And I'll show you right to it!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.710
Huh?! Wai—

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.760
<i>Kanade and I were supposed 
to have separate rooms,</i>

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.450
<i>but with no others open, 
we got stuck here together!</i>

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.640
I bet I'll sleep really well tonight!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.600
Come try the beds, Rein!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.730
I...

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.230
I'm camping out tonight!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.950
What?! Why? Why?!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.270
We already paid for the week!

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.780
There are bigger things at stake!

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.990
I can't sleep in the same room as a girl!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.310
I don't mind spending the 
night with <i>you</i>, Rein!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.580
You <i>should</i>! I'm a guy, remember?

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:12.080
Well, the notion of sharing 
a room with a guy like you,

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.040
does make me feel a little embarrassed.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.690
But I know you're not <i>that</i> kind 
of guy, so I'm okay with it!

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:20.380
Okay?

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:23.760
<i>I can't tell if she's too 
kind or just too ignorant...</i>

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:28.720
Listen, Kanade. 
You can't trust people so easily.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.800
We only just met,

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:33.210
and we barely know each other.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:37.400
What makes you so sure you can trust me?

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:39.860
I'm going.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:42.820
I...

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.100
It's not that I'd trust just anybody.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.620
I trust you, because you're you.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.620
You're not like other people.

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.540
Even if we only just met,

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.480
we're still comrades, right?

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:05.470
And I can't let my faithful 
comrade sleep outside!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.540
Comrades just don't do that!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.480
You know?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.380
I got it.

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:12.860
I won't sleep outside.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.040
I'll sleep here.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.000
Really?!

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.720
Yeah.

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.110
Well, glad to hear it!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:23.820
<i>It's been one surprise after 
another since I met her.</i>

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.490
<i>I just can't argue with her.</i>

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:33.820
But, but... You should look 
away while I'm changing, okay?

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:35.000
Obviously!

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.630
He's so cute when he sleeps.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.600
<i>Rein really is a good guy.</i>

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:54.800
<i>Even among the ultimate species, 
cat spirits like me are rare.</i>

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:59.260
<i>Countless humans have tried 
to catch me because of that.</i>

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:04.610
<i>Some approach me hoping 
to get ahead in the world.</i>

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:08.070
<i>Money, greed, glory...</i>

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.580
<i>That's all those people wanted.</i>

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.720
<i>But that's when I met...</i>

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:18.550
Hey, are you okay?

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.420
<i>...Rein!</i>

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:26.090
<i>Rein was surprised to 
meet me, but that's not all.</i>

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.090
<i>He saved me out of sheer goodwill.</i>

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:32.510
<i>He interacted with me like 
I was any other girl.</i>

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:37.480
<i>I can't express how happy that made me!</i>

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:48.760
<i>I bet Rein's still hurting from 
being kicked out of his party.</i>

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:52.540
<i>He's acting like he doesn't care,</i>

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.450
<i>but I'm sure he's still bothered, deep down.</i>

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.760
<i>I'd like to heal that wound.</i>

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:02.500
<i>I want to see Rein smile from 
the bottom of his heart.</i>

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.650
<i>No matter what happens,</i>

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.190
<i>I'll always be with you, Rein.</i>

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.940
<i>It's been a week since I first met Kanade.</i>

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:17.850
Rein!

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.040
We've been smoothly working through our jobs,

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.930
enjoying the laid-back 
life of the adventurer.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.680
Want some?

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.570
Thanks.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.790
The Guard Dog of Stride Bridge?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:39.850
Yes. A true hooligan has 
appeared on Stride Bridge.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:40.750
Hooligan?

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:46.090
They're picking fights with 
anyone who tries to cross.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:49.760
They, apparently, leave once 
they've deemed the battle won,

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.140
so they fortunately haven't killed anyone...

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.470
But it's really deterring 
people from using the bridge.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.060
And so...

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.260
What do you think, Rein?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.390
Will you take the job?

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:04.110
You think E-ranks, like us, are qualified?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.130
Yes!

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:07.520
This job is available to all ranks!

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:10.570
Whoever beats the hooligan 
first gets the reward!

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.030
And the reward is quite high!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.100
Five gold pieces!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:16.900
I'll take it!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.200
Thank you so much!

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:27.540
Isn't it a big bridge, Rein?

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.760
<i>Stride Bridge.</i>

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:33.450
<i>It's the only way to travel from the Central 
Continent, where Horizon is located,</i>

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:34.850
<i>to the Southern Continent.</i>

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.650
Isn't it amazing?!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.960
I've never seen anything like it!

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:41.440
That's right. I guess you've 
never been here before.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:45.610
But what kind of person do you 
think this "Guard Dog" is?

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:46.920
Good question.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.740
<i>Normally, if no one's died,</i>

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.740
<i>you'd be able to ask witnesses 
about the culprit's identity.</i>

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:56.410
<i>But the people who got 
beaten refused to talk,</i>

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.110
<i>so I couldn't get any information 
about the Guard Dog's identity.</i>

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.950
<i>A completely unknown enemy!</i>

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.460
<i>I'll have to make sure 
not to let my guard down.</i>

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.430
Rein!

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:06.810
What is it?

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.580
Look at that!

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.150
D-D-D...

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.090
Dragon?!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.900
I sense power here.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.360
Hey, you two! Fight me!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.700
The dragon... was a girl?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.350
Are you listening to me?!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:37.410
Sorry!

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:40.010
But can I ask one question?

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:42.370
Are you the Guard Dog who's been 
raising havoc on this bridge?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.710
Guard Dog?

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.040
Not exactly my favorite nickname,

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.330
but I guess that'd be me.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.940
I'm Tania of the ultimate 
species, dragonoids!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.800
I'm using this bridge for training.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.980
Training?!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.510
It's the law among the dragonoids.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:09:00.830
Once they turn 15, they set out on 
a journey to become properly strong.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:01.980
I think.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:04.230
Aren't you the knowledgeable one? Exactly.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.190
I've been searching for somebody strong.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.240
A first-rate adventurer and cat spirit...

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.400
Perfect opponents upon 
which to hone my strength.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.650
I'm just fine with a two-on-one fight.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.390
But I'm not leaving this 
bridge until you fight me!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.580
It looks like we'll have to fight her.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:25.080
I wasn't expecting to fight a 
dragon, an ultimate species...

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.200
Rein.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.090
Don't worry! I'm an ultimate 
species, too, remember?

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:33.800
That's true!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.630
All ready, are we?

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.850
Now, let us begin!

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:47.350
Rein!

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.280
Not bad at all.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.990
That single blow's taken out about 
half of those I've fought so far.

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:57.640
<i>I'll bet.</i>

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.750
<i>I only just barely blocked it, myself!</i>

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:06.300
That means you pass the first test.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.620
But what about this?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.380
Dodge!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:17.130
<i>Don't take on human form if you're 
just gonna do dragon stuff!</i>

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:19.290
Kanade!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:20.650
It's hot! It's hot!

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.510
Don't move! I'll put it out!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.480
My beautiful tail!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.300
Okay, now I'm mad!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:33.690
Finally up for the fight?

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:42.940
<i>Amazing...</i>

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:46.120
<i>Two ultimate species... 
they're on even footing.</i>

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:49.820
<i>It feels a little like cheating...</i>

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:50.790
But...

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.180
<i>If we attack at the same time...</i>

00:10:58.820 --> 00:10:59.550
Wha—

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.130
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.280
H-Hang on!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:10.280
And away you go!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.110
<i>Not good!</i>

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:16.070
<i>Even with the ability boosts granted 
from my contract with Kanade,</i>

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.530
<i>I still can't fly!</i>

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.740
<i>If she attacks us now...</i>

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.900
Well done, you two.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:48.670
You're the first to ever last this long.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.390
I'm starting to enjoy this more and more!

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:54.620
<i>She really is an ultimate species.</i>

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:55.810
<i>So strong...</i>

00:11:56.840 --> 00:12:01.190
<i>Maybe it was arrogant to think we could 
beat a dragonoid in hand-to-hand combat.</i>

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.620
<i>I need to fight like a real beast tamer.</i>

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:07.740
Kanade.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:11.050
Can you buy me five minutes... no, three?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.160
I just thought of a plan.

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.440
A plan?

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:18.030
If you buy me time, 
I'll work out the rest on my own.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:19.550
Okay! Leave it to me!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.340
Thanks!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.820
Is your little strategy meeting over?

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:27.690
Yeah!

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.510
Now, then...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.480
Let's get serious!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.630
Well, look at you go!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:46.120
But how long will your 
stamina hold up like this?

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.370
Don't worry about that!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.580
Rein said he has an idea!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.840
<i>Hey! Don't tell her our plan!</i>

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:55.790
No. I need to focus.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.980
<i>I needed to focus my mind.</i>

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.860
<i>When Tania sent me flying,</i>

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.730
<i>I felt a presence... faintly...</i>

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.090
I found it!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.570
Will you bring your friends here?

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:15.850
Yes! Good girl!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:26.810
Kanade!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.620
Leave the rest to me!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.410
What, am I fighting you next?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.800
No... you're fighting them!

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.710
What is all this?!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.550
What's going on?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.690
It doesn't actually hurt, but...

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:47.180
it's extremely irritating!

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:48.200
Stop it!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:52.010
Trying to create a smokescreen, were you?

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.480
You can't possibly have 
thought that would hurt me.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.060
Don't make me laugh!

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:59.270
An attack like that could 
never hurt a dragonoid...

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:02.230
like... me...

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.920
What's going on?

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:12.200
I can't... move.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.440
This is a pito.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.640
The bright plumage is a sign 
that they're poisonous.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:19.540
Poisonous?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:24.750
That big a dose of poison should keep even 
a dragonoid like you down for a while.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.320
Fine! I give up!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.930
I lose!

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.840
Wow, that was fast.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:40.300
Well, I can't even lift a finger.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.320
How could I possibly win?

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.860
We did it!

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:48.670
Rein! We won!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:49.820
Yeah! We did it!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.520
Yay!

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.910
All right, Tania.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.810
You need to come with us.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:59.370
Why? Going to sell me to some other human?

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.440
Of course not.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.070
I just want to talk with you.

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:06.590
And I hope you'll promise me that you'll 
never do anything like this ever again.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.380
And if I refuse?

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:12.920
In that case...

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.430
I don't know! I'd be in a real fix!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.050
What kind of response is that?

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:27.110
You could just take me anywhere 
and do anything you want...

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:29.500
What a weirdo.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.550
That super hurts!

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.490
What are you doing?!

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.320
Stop making trouble for Rein!

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:39.580
This is punishment for bad girls!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.260
I got it! I'll go! I'll go already!

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.920
I get it! Just cut it out!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.520
<i>It never ends...</i>

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.470
You drove off the Guard 
Dog of Stride Bridge?!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.100
Y-Yes!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.090
I beat the hooligan and got a guarantee.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.400
The bridge should be safe from now on.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.960
That's our Rein!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.400
I just knew you could beat that quest!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.050
We'll give you your reward 
after we confirm your story.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.360
But thank you so much!

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:17.450
By the way... who is that?

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:21.720
The tail and horns...

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:22.580
Is she a drago—

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:25.120
No! Just someone we met 
on the course of the job!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.730
She's human, and... her appearance is just...

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.250
Right! It's just a costume!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.670
Oh, I see!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.510
Don't you dare speak for me!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.220
I'm not some kind of weirdo!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.800
Allow me to tell you.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.040
I am the queen of the skies,

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:39.820
a dragon—

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.480
We'll be going now! See you!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.100
See you!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.070
If they learn you were the 
Guard Dog of Stride Bridge,

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.840
it'll throw the whole town into a panic.

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.160
So don't you go telling anyone—

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.120
Tania?

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.450
You! Fight me!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.370
Hey!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.730
What the heck? She's awesome!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.620
How do you do it?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:06.440
You wish to know who I really a—

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:11.200
Seriously, don't tell anyone 
what you really are!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.510
After we worked so hard to hide it...

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:16.620
S-Sorry, I forgot.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.430
Now, as for what we'll do with you next...

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.390
Try to get as far from this town as you can.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.590
You're sure?

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:32.360
Fortunately, word of the Guard Dog of 
Stride Bridge hasn't spread very far.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:36.070
Just promise you won't do 
anything like that ever again.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:40.380
Hey, why do you think those guys 
wouldn't tell you about Tania?

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:41.580
That's a good question.

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.500
Did you scare them into silence or something?

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.370
Of course not.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.540
Oh, but...

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.440
They <i>were</i> all rather bummed 
about losing to a girl.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:53.620
<i>That's the reason none of them talked?!</i>

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.090
You're really not going to take me in?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:58.920
Nah.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:02.200
Just take your training somewhere 
you won't make trouble.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:04.520
I s-suppose...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.950
Seeing as I couldn't even beat you two,

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:10.490
that training couldn't have 
been very good for me anyway.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:14.940
But the dragonoid rule is that 
you have to keep training, right?

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.300
Well, about that...

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:21.120
I thought I'd tag along with you guys!

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:23.580
Why would you do that?!

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:27.160
Seems like hanging out with you 
would be pretty good training.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.600
Plus, it sounds fun!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.400
Besides...

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:32.510
Rein, was it?

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:34.960
I find that I like you.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.130
You protected me back there.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.120
Wait! Get away from my master!

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.680
What's this, now? Jealous?

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.300
O-Of course not!

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:46.490
I just thought Rein seemed bothered, so...

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.090
It's just a little hug.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.300
Nobody likes a girl who won't share.

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:52.610
<i>She's already picking fights...</i>

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:56.580
Well, I don't mind having Tania in our party.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.070
What do you think, Kanade?

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.070
I... I...

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.400
I'm fine with it.

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:07.040
Tania's a little mean, 
but I like her just fine.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.450
Then, that's that!

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:09.900
Well, then, Rein.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.640
Form a contract with me!

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.280
You have a contract with Kanade,

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:16.460
so you should form a contract with me, too!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.880
R-Right...

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.550
<i>I can't believe I'm forming a 
contract with not only a cat spirit,</i>

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:26.010
<i>but with a dragonoid, too.</i>

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:33.580
Are you ready?

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:34.940
Yes, anytime.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.820
My name is Rein Shroud.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.980
In establishing this new contract,
 a bond is formed.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.820
An oath in our hearts, hope in our souls...

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:48.820
Your power, in my hand.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.250
Speak now your name.

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:57.210
Tania.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:12.810
Is it over?

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.970
Yeah. The contract is sealed.

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.910
See? You got a weird pattern 
on your hand, right?

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:19.780
This?

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:24.120
So this is what it feels 
like to be tamed, eh?

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:30.640
It's strange... it feels like I'd be 
connected to Rein no matter where I am.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:32.660
But it's kind of nice.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.630
<i>I feel like I've used up an 
entire lifetime's worth of luck!</i>

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.930
Hey, you!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.490
You just got to seal a contract with me!

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:42.510
So why do you look so unhappy?

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.780
Happy to work with you, my master!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:54.140
Damn it!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:57.610
A whole week in the woods for nothing.

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:01.070
I'm pooped. I wanna take a bath!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:05.950
Exploring while fighting monsters 
is harder than I expected.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.850
And carrying around our provisions was hard.

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:10.240
All jobs we used to have Rein do...

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:14.830
Why do I have to do that 
piece of trash's job?!

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.310
But what can we do about it now?

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:19.320
It seems difficult to progress.

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.790
I know. Let's bring Rein back.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:29.500
We'll say we're sorry, 
that we totally didn't mean it.

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.080
Then he'll come right back.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.180
He's stupidly nice anyway.

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:39.470
Then, after we clear out the Lost Woods,

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:41.400
we'll abandon him again.

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.290
I want to look at Rein's face as he sleeps!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.460
I don't care! Let me have the bed!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:58.540
No!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.630
You're so stingy!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.100
I said no!

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:02.790
And I said you're stingy!

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:40.020
Dragonoid Power

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:38.940
Next Time: "Dragonoid Power."
